# Simulated input series for e11: ~24 MB of float64 traces, regenerated exactly by
# `python e11_theiler_contrast.py --simulate`. The scored outputs beside them are the
# result; these are the intermediate the scorer reads, and they stay out of the repo
# for the same reason gromov_arithmetic keeps its weight snapshots out.
results/e11_theiler_contrast/series/

# The e10 ceiling sweep's 27 x 64,000-sample records, ~95 MB, regenerated exactly by
# `python e10_ceiling_sweep.py --simulate`. Each shorter record in the sweep is a prefix
# of one of these, so the scored outputs beside them carry the whole result.
results/e10_ceiling/trajectories/
